    "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"J_module\" render=\"true\" module-title=\"detailProductNavigation\" module-id=\"24995778587\">\n<div data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i69.53a0246cuboQLl\" class=\"magic-0\" data-section-title=\"Product Description\" data-section=\"AliMagic-aj7ojl\" id=\"ali-anchor-AliMagic-aj7ojl\">Product Description</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"J_module\" render=\"true\" module-title=\"detailTableNoTitle\" module-id=\"24995778588\">\n<div class=\"ife-detail-decorate-table\">\n<h1>Nature3D 1.75mm 1kg PLA Pro Светофарно Червен Филамент</h1>\n<h2>Изразете Вашата Креативност със Светофарно Червения PLA Pro</h2>\n<h3>Животът в Цвят: Светофарно Червено Изкуство</h3>\n<p>Освежете визията на вашите проекти с Nature3D 1.75mm 1kg PLA Pro Светофарно Червен филамент. Този наситен червен цвят придава на вашите модели живот и интензивност, които ще бъдат забелязани.</p>\n<h3>Превъзходство в Червено: PLA Pro за Изключителни Творения</h3>\n<p>Отделете се от останалите с Nature3D PLA Pro Светофарно Червен. Не само заради висококачествения си цвят, но и заради издръжливостта и стабилността, които предоставя. Вашият проект заслужава най-доброто, затова изберете Nature3D.</p>\n<h3>Интензивно Изживяване: Светофарно Червената Емоция</h3>\n<p>Съчетайте въображението си със страстта на Светофарно Червения PLA Pro. Оцветете света около вас с интензивност и радост. С този филамент от Nature3D, всяко творение става проява на вашия уникален стил.</p>\n<p> <br></p>\n<table class=\"all magic-1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Product Name</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i68.53a0246cuboQLl\" class=\"magic-3\">PLA+ 3D FILAMENT</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Material</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">100% Virgin PLA Pellets, Food Grade</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Function</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">3D Printing/Modeling</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.pc-decorate.0.i114.42913333EdVbiA\">Package</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">Box + Vacuum seal + Desiccant</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Recommended Print Layer Resolution</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">0.1~0.2mm</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Print Bed Temp</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">50~60℃</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Print Raft</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">Not necessary</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Tensile strength</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">≥60MPa</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Flexural Strength</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">≥60MPa</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Flexural Modulus</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">≥2500MPa</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Impact Strength(IZOD,23℃)</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">≥50J/m (ASTM D256)</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Elongation at break</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">≥10%</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-2\"><b>Distortion Temperature</b></div>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-3\">≥53℃</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>",
